  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In build 1245, the shader property _VRChatCameraMode is set by VRC to have unique values for non-camera (0), vr/desktop hand camera (1/2), and screenshot (3). However, there is no unique value for taking a photo - instead, it has the same value as in the hand camera preview (1 or 2, depending on desktop or VR).\n\nPlease add an additional unique value (4?) for taking a photo with the camera, for full granularity. Or, at least set the same value used for screenshots (3).",
